    <unit id="SemanticDraggerDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Drag bar element carrying the semantic-dragger class that resizes adjacent panels.</source>
        <target state="translated">攜帶 semantic-dragger 類的拖動條元素，用於調整相鄰面板的尺寸。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPanelDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Panel container element carrying the semantic-panel class with adjustable size and clipped content.</source>
        <target state="translated">攜帶 semantic-panel 類的面板容器元素，具有可調整的尺寸與裁剪的內容。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPartStyleDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Mirrors the Ant Design style-class demo: customize the root background and the dragger through generated Semantic Part styles, and outline the root with a dashed border.</source>
        <target state="translated">對齊 Ant Design style-class 範例：透過生成的 Semantic Part 樣式自訂 root 背景與拖動條，並為 root 加上虛線邊框。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
